{
  "name": "Sanaku - Invite Client User",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Invite a client to the portal\n\nCreating an auth user needs the service_role key, which must NEVER reach the browser - so the dashboard calls this webhook instead.\n\n**This endpoint is an authorization boundary.** An unauthenticated invite endpoint would let anyone who finds the URL attach THEIR OWN account to ANY client_id, defeating every RLS policy. So:\n\n1. The caller must send their own Supabase session token as `Authorization: Bearer <token>`.\n2. We verify it against `/auth/v1/user` - a forged token fails here.\n3. We check that verified user id is in `sanaku_staff`.\n4. Only then do we invite, and the new user's id comes from the Admin API response - **never from the request body**.\n\nPayload: `{ \"email\": \"owner@client.com\", \"client_id\": \"<uuid>\" }`\n\nCredentials: \"Supabase Service Role (Custom Auth)\".\nEnv: SUPABASE_URL, DASHBOARD_URL (where the invite link lands).",
        "height": 440,
        "width": 520
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000099",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        40,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "invite-client-user",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {
          "allowedOrigins": "*"
        }
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Invite Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        140,
        560
      ],
      "webhookId": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000101"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "// Pull the caller's token and the requested invite out of the request.\n// Note what is NOT read here: any user_id from the body. The invited user's id\n// comes from the Admin API response only.\nconst req = $input.first().json || {};\nconst h = req.headers || {};\nconst b = req.body || {};\nconst auth = h.authorization || h.Authorization || '';\nconst token = auth.replace(/^Bearer\\s+/i, '').trim();\nconst email = String(b.email || '').trim().toLowerCase();\nconst clientId = String(b.client_id || '').trim();\nconst uuid = /^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$/i;\n\nif (!token) return [{ json: { ok: false, code: 401, error: 'missing caller token' } }];\nif (!/^[^@\\s]+@[^@\\s]+\\.[^@\\s]+$/.test(email)) return [{ json: { ok: false, code: 400, error: 'invalid email' } }];\nif (!uuid.test(clientId)) return [{ json: { ok: false, code: 400, error: 'invalid client_id' } }];\n\nreturn [{ json: { ok: true, token, email, client_id: clientId } }];"
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Read Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        360,
        560
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "well-formed",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.ok === true }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "Well Formed?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        580,
        560
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_URL }}/auth/v1/user",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $json.token }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "apikey",
              "value": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_ANON_KEY }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Verify Caller Token",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        800,
        480
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "GET",
        "url": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_URL }}/rest/v1/sanaku_staff?user_id=eq.{{ $json.id }}&select=user_id&limit=1",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpCustomAuth",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Caller Is Staff?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1020,
        480
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpCustomAuth": {
          "id": "supabase-custom-auth",
          "name": "Supabase Service Role (Custom Auth)"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "alwaysOutputData": true
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "is-staff",
              "leftValue": "={{ !!$json.user_id }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Authorized?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        1240,
        480
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_URL }}/auth/v1/invite",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpCustomAuth",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ email: $('Read Request').first().json.email, data: { client_id: $('Read Request').first().json.client_id }, redirect_to: $env.DASHBOARD_URL }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 20000
        }
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Send Invite",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1460,
        400
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpCustomAuth": {
          "id": "supabase-custom-auth",
          "name": "Supabase Service Role (Custom Auth)"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000,
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $env.SUPABASE_URL }}/rest/v1/sanaku_client_users?on_conflict=user_id,client_id",
        "authentication": "genericCredentialType",
        "genericAuthType": "httpCustomAuth",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Prefer",
              "value": "resolution=merge-duplicates,return=minimal"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ user_id: $json.id, client_id: $('Read Request').first().json.client_id }) }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "Link User To Client",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1680,
        400
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "httpCustomAuth": {
          "id": "supabase-custom-auth",
          "name": "Supabase Service Role (Custom Auth)"
        }
      },
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "onError": "continueErrorOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ ok: true, message: 'Invite sent' }) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 200,
          "responseHeaders": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "name": "Access-Control-Allow-Origin",
                "value": "*"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000009",
      "name": "Respond Invited",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1900,
        400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ ok: false, error: $('Verify Caller Token').first().json.id ? 'you are signed in, but your account is not in sanaku_staff' : 'Supabase would not verify your login (' + ($('Verify Caller Token').first().json.msg || $('Verify Caller Token').first().json.message || 'no id returned') + ')' }) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 403,
          "responseHeaders": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "name": "Access-Control-Allow-Origin",
                "value": "*"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "Respond Denied",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1460,
        700
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ ok: false, error: (function(){  const e = $json.error || {};  const b = e.body || e.response || e || $json;  const m = String(b.msg || b.message || b.error_description || b.error || e.message || '');  if (/already|registered|exists/i.test(m)) return 'That email already has an account, so it cannot be invited again. Use an alias like you+client@gmail.com - same inbox, new user.';  return m || 'Supabase rejected the invite and gave no reason.';})() }) }}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 400,
          "responseHeaders": {
            "entries": [
              {
                "name": "Access-Control-Allow-Origin",
                "value": "*"
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "name": "Respond Failed",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1680,
        620
      ]
    }
  ],
